Project adaptations: compact answer normalization; algebraically equivalent F1;
project task/reference schema; dictionary-based SciFact count primitives;
explicit failure accounting, claim-level adaptation and retrieval metrics.
The public distribution provenance header changes no scorer behavior.

Benchmark text, annotations/Gold, model weights, backend/CUDA binaries and
complete upstream evaluator programs are not included in this distribution.
